      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MULWEE JAFFA (1) goes very well at the course and distance with three wins and a placing from six starts. Placed last time (17.82) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 1.75 lengths. Rates a leading player. GORGEOUS GOSSIP (2) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 300m behind Oxley Flyer (17.83) in a Grade 5. Placed at her previous run. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BELLA ZEST (4) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last start finished 3rd in a Grade 5 on November 7 over 300m at this track behind Becky Belle beaten 4.5 lengths (17.81). Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Can measure up. BARRELLED (6) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
